  "body": "https://w3c.github.io/IntersectionObserver/#pending-initial-observation describes an additional requirement for skipping document rendering in the HTML Event Loops Processing Model, one which is not documented in the _Unnecessary rendering_ portion of the [_Update the rendering_ step](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#update-the-rendering). This change adds this requirement directly to the processing model spec.\n\nI'll follow up with a corresponding change to [w3c/IntersectionObserver](https://w3c.github.io/IntersectionObserver/#pending-initial-observation) to close corresponding issue  w3c/IntersectionObserver#498.\n\nFixes #8015\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8016/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 16, 2022, 4:51 PM UTC (3beb96a)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8016/5aa1a59...3beb96a/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 16, 2022, 4:51 PM UTC (3beb96a)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8016/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 16, 2022, 4:51 PM UTC (3beb96a)\">/webappapis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8016/5aa1a59...3beb96a/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 16, 2022, 4:51 PM UTC (3beb96a)\">diff</a> )",
